{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven Seeker \u00d7 OPENREC Collaboration Free DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a skin DLC featuring the top four winners of the Heaven Seeker event on OPENREC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free additional content grants access to special skills that change the character\u2019s appearance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Zonomari Form&quot;, &quot;Ares Form&quot;, &quot;Parunyan Form&quot;, and &quot;Egokoro Echo Form&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After obtaining this DLC, a special NPC will appear in the entrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By viewing the conversation event, you can unlock the skill to change your character's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Zonomari Form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-Changes the Seeker\u2019s appearance to Maria Kurenoni.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-The initial Grimoire is changed to &quot;Kenzoku Koumori&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Ares Form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-Changes the Seeker\u2019s appearance to Ares Sch\u00fctile Nacht.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-The initial Grimoire is changed to &quot;Blue Flare&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Parunyan Form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-Changes the Seeker\u2019s appearance to Parunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-The initial Grimoire is changed to &quot;Banana Blast&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Egokoro Echo Form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-Changes the Seeker\u2019s appearance to E-chan (Egokoro Echo).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000-The initial Grimoire is changed to &quot;Kiss-Kiss-Kiss&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the Grimoires &quot;Ken-zoku Bat&quot;, &quot;Blue Flare&quot;, &quot;Banana Blast&quot;, and &quot;Kiss Kiss Kiss&quot; will now appear in dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This content requires the separately sold full version of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This content does not add new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skill only changes appearance and initial items. In event scenes and Sky Castle History, the original character will still be used.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508810?t=1741254710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508810?t=1741254710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508810/774b2792f7da308a7fe193636a3c66cda2fc73a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741254710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508810/774b2792f7da308a7fe193636a3c66cda2fc73a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741254710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven Seeker \u00d7 OPENREC Collaboration Free DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a skin DLC featuring the top four winners of the Heaven Seeker event on OPENREC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free additional content grants access to special skills that change the character\u2019s appearance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Zonomari Form&quot;, &quot;Ares Form&quot;, &quot;Parunyan Form&quot;, and &quot;Egokoro Echo Form&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After obtaining this DLC, 